WEBVTT

00:04:58.919 --> 00:05:02.798
"Being a guardian helped get me
through the tough times in my life.

00:05:04.383 --> 00:05:08.304
Being connected to the land
and talking with elders

00:05:08.346 --> 00:05:10.389
helped me overcome my addictions.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.391
It brought pride to me.

00:05:13.017 --> 00:05:16.228
And at the end of the day,
I could walk away with the pride

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.813
of being First Nations."

00:05:19.565 --> 00:05:24.445
(Applause)

00:05:24.737 --> 00:05:26.238
I know what he means.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.699
As a person who's been a witness to

00:05:28.699 --> 00:05:33.037
and felt the intergenerational trauma
from the colonial experience